shape: sequence_diagram
w: "TrackingWorker\n(constructor)"
d: "suppress_nested_\nsame_class_boxes"
f: "Frame loop\n(worker thread)"
w -> w: deep-copy source layer
w -> d: frame 7: full-body + torso boxes
d -> d: IoMin 0.99 >= 0.80, same class
d -> w: one box, union bounds
w -> f: cleaned snapshot after all frames
f -> f: associate one box, not two
